quiz.prompt:
You press and release the button three times (no bounce). What appears in the serial monitor, in order?

```
int onceki = HIGH;

void loop() {
  int sayac = 0;
  int simdi = digitalRead(2);
  if (onceki == HIGH && simdi == LOW) {
    sayac++;
    Serial.println(sayac);
  }
  onceki = simdi;
}
```

When you press the bell button without pressing the mute button (D3), the buzzer does not beep; when you press the bell while the mute button is held, it beeps. It should be the other way round. Which line is wrong?

```
bool sessiz = (digitalRead(3) == LOW);
digitalWrite(13, HIGH);
if (sessiz) {
  digitalWrite(8, HIGH);
}
delay(300);
digitalWrite(13, LOW);
digitalWrite(8, LOW);
